Keep a shared words as an empty list of text.
Place "time" into words.
Place "me" into words.
Place "bell" into words.
Keep a shared covered as 0.
Keep a shared measured as 0.
Keep a shared total as 0.

To measure from spot (a whole number).
Set measured to 0.
The word is item spot of words.
For every place from 0 to the last position of word.
Add 1 to measured.

To suffix from other (a whole number) with spot (a whole number).
The word is item other of words.
Measure from other.
The wordsize is measured.
Measure from spot.
The heresize is measured.
The start is wordsize minus heresize.
The tail is the slice of word from start to wordsize.
If tail matches item spot of words, set covered to 1.

To cover from spot (a whole number).
Set covered to 0.
Measure from spot.
The heresize is measured.
For every other from 0 to the last position of words.
Measure from other.
The othersize is measured.
If other is not spot and othersize is more than heresize, suffix from other with spot.

To extend from spot (a whole number).
Measure from spot.
The size is measured.
Add size plus 1 to total.

For every spot from 0 to the last position of words.
Cover from spot.
If covered is 0, extend from spot.

Show total.
